# Code owners for this infrastructure-live repository. The bootstrap's ruleset
# requires code owner review by default (require_code_owner_review), so a pull
# request touching a path below needs an approval from its owner.
#
# Replace @<org>/<platform-team> with a team that exists in this organization
# and has write access. GitHub skips a line whose owner it cannot resolve, so
# until then these paths need no owner review.

# The engine callers, runner workflows, invariants script, and this file.
/.github/       @<org>/<platform-team>

# Engine discovery and the gate hooks.
/projects.yml   @<org>/<platform-team>
